{"id": "EUVD-2026-108289", "enisaUuid": "9f95f175-374c-35bb-8e69-af6ab98019ad", "description": "OpenBao before 2.6.3 contains a missing authorization check that allows attackers to stop Agent and Proxy services by omitting the X-Vault-Header. When require_request_header is enabled, attackers can send requests via server-side request forgery to /agent/v1/quit or /proxy/v1/quit to shut down these services.", "datePublished": "2026-10-22T19:13:38", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-22T19:13:38", "baseScore": 2.1, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:P/PR:H/UI:N/VC:N/VI:N/VA:L/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/openbao/openbao/security/advisories/GHSA-8gmq-wv9h-fcwp", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/openbao-before-2.6.3-missing-header-check-on-agent-proxy-quit-endpoints"], "aliases": ["GHSA-rw7f-qpfc-j3vm", "CVE-2026-115364"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.0, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "ed3e0633-132a-3974-afef-c4aa016173e9", "product": {"name": "openbao", "vendor": {"name": "openbao"}}, "product_version": "0 <2.6.3"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "a1d05d7f-bf80-33e6-9531-3899f5580edc", "vendor": {"name": "openbao"}}], "isExploited": false}